// endpoint_select_response.proto — SelectResponse: move or clear the
// response-selection cursor for one workspace. FEED section.
//
// Reply-to-a-past-response mode. The user, in the input window's command
// mode, walks the ordered final-response rows (`C-p` = PREV, `C-n` = NEXT)
// and clears the selection (double-escape). The DAEMON owns the selection
// state per workspace — it knows the ordered final-response rows, so it
